.SH Notes

std::basic_spanbuf does not own the underlying buffer.

It is the responsibility of programmers to ensure the underlying buffer is in its lifetime
when used by a std::basic_spanbuf object. Additional synchronization may be needed if more
than one thread operates the same underlying buffer through different std::basic_spanbuf
objects.

